>(0) and J<sub>1</sub>(0)=?", "option1": "0 and 1 respectively", "option2": "1 and 0 respectively", "option3": "Both are 0", "option4": "Both are 1", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-23_105523628.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"377\" height=\"132\" />okay give</p>"}, {"id": "39", "question": "৩৯) Which of the following integrals is nonzero?", "option1": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1_jO8yopH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"60\" />", "option2": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/2_RSp8Tty.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"313\" height=\"61\" />", "option3": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/3_RQqJdM0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"44\" />", "option4": "<img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/4_8kKtlXn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"46\" />", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p><img src=\"https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/image_2025-08-22_012325777.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"488\" height=\"55\" /></p>"}, {"id": "40", "question": "৪০) P<sub>2</sub>(-1)=?", "option1": "0", "option2": "1", "option3": "-1", "option4": "2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>P<sup>n</sup>(-1)=(-1)<sup>n<br></sup>​Putting n=2 we get P<sup>2</sup>(-1)=1</p>"}]}, "_source": "archive-question-subject", "_exam_id": 12098, "custom_field": "প্রতি প্রশ্নের মান ১ ও ভুল উত্তরের জন্য ০.৫০ কাটা যাবে।", "exam_time": "2400000", "is_omr": true, "omr_time": "2700000", "examname": "Aug 27, 2025", "type": "Math-Sub-561-applied", "payment": "BALANCE_NOT"}